From e74ce39be3c05030bef9b8501d1eafeebbc84533 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mariawerba <mariawerba@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Mar 2026 00:00:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] add Sitronix ST7102 TDDI touchscreen driver

Upstream-Status: Pending

Add the Sitronix touchscreen driver for the ST7102 TDDI controller
used on the Densitron DMT049W1NTCMI-1A display module.
